  "title": "Product tile",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 20.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A product people tap to add to a sale or an order: picture, name, one meta line and the price, with a badge in the corner that counts how many are already in the sale. The whole tile is one button.",
    "id": "Produk yang diketuk untuk ditambahkan ke penjualan atau pesanan: gambar, nama, satu baris meta, dan harga, dengan badge di sudut yang menghitung berapa yang sudah masuk ke penjualan. Seluruh tile adalah satu tombol."
  },
  "titleId": "Product tile",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A point-of-sale grid",
        "desc": "The till at an UMKM gallery during a city expo. The count in the corner and the accent ring say what is already in the sale; low stock is said in words; the sold-out tile fades and says when it is back.",
        "html": "<div class=\"ptile-grid\" style=\"max-width: 680px;\">\n  <button class=\"ptile is-in\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Siger motif ceramic mug, set of 2, Rp 85.000, 2 in this sale\"><span class=\"ptile__media\"><img src=\"https://lampung.kartadinata.app/docs/examples/dashboard/img/products/stoneware-mug.svg\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"ptile__body\"><span class=\"ptile__name\">Siger motif ceramic mug, set of 2</span><span class=\"ptile__meta\">36 in stock</span></span><span class=\"ptile__price\">Rp 85.000</span><span class=\"ptile__qty\">2</span></button>\n  <button class=\"ptile\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Lampung coffee scented candle, Rp 45.000\"><span class=\"ptile__media\"><img src=\"https://lampung.kartadinata.app/docs/examples/dashboard/img/products/soy-candle.svg\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"ptile__body\"><span class=\"ptile__name\">Lampung coffee scented candle</span><span class=\"ptile__meta ptile__meta--low\">4 left</span></span><span class=\"ptile__price\">Rp 45.000</span><span class=\"ptile__qty\" hidden></span></button>\n  <button class=\"ptile\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Tapis trim canvas tote, Rp 65.000\"><span class=\"ptile__media\"><img src=\"https://lampung.kartadinata.app/docs/examples/dashboard/img/products/canvas-tote.svg\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"ptile__body\"><span class=\"ptile__name\">Tapis trim canvas tote</span><span class=\"ptile__meta\">58 in stock</span></span><span class=\"ptile__price\">Rp 65.000</span><span class=\"ptile__qty\" hidden></span></button>\n  <button class=\"ptile\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Wooden watch, 38 mm, Rp 350.000\"><span class=\"ptile__media\"><img src=\"https://lampung.kartadinata.app/docs/examples/dashboard/img/products/field-watch.svg\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"ptile__body\"><span class=\"ptile__name\">Wooden watch, 38 mm</span><span class=\"ptile__meta\">Sold out until 2 Dec</span></span><span class=\"ptile__price\">Rp 350.000</span><span class=\"ptile__qty\" hidden></span></button>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"ptile-grid\">\n  <button class=\"ptile is-in\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Siger motif ceramic mug, set of 2, Rp 85.000, 2 in this sale\">\n    <span class=\"ptile__media\"><img src=\"img/products/stoneware-mug.svg\" alt=\"\"></span>\n    <span class=\"ptile__body\"><span class=\"ptile__name\">Siger motif ceramic mug, set of 2</span><span class=\"ptile__meta\">36 in stock</span></span>\n    <span class=\"ptile__price\">Rp 85.000</span>\n    <span class=\"ptile__qty\">2</span>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"ptile\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Wooden watch, 38 mm, Rp 350.000, sold out\">…<span class=\"ptile__meta\">Sold out until 2 Dec</span>…</button>\n</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  // On tap: add to the sale, then show the count and pop it\n  qty.hidden = false; qty.textContent = n; qty.classList.remove('is-bump'); void qty.offsetWidth; qty.classList.add('is-bump');\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Compact, in a narrow panel",
        "desc": "`ptile--compact` puts the picture beside the name: for a side panel, quick picks or a long list on a phone.",
        "html": "<div class=\"ptile-grid\" style=\"--min: 240px; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <button class=\"ptile ptile--compact\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Tapis motif cotton tee, Rp 95.000\"><span class=\"ptile__media\"><img src=\"https://lampung.kartadinata.app/docs/examples/dashboard/img/products/crew-tee.svg\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"ptile__body\"><span class=\"ptile__name\">Tapis motif cotton tee</span><span class=\"ptile__meta\">S, M, L</span></span><span class=\"ptile__price\">Rp 95.000</span><span class=\"ptile__qty\" hidden></span></button>\n  <button class=\"ptile ptile--compact is-in\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Tapis cover notebook, A5, Rp 30.000, 1 in this sale\"><span class=\"ptile__media\"><img src=\"https://lampung.kartadinata.app/docs/examples/dashboard/img/products/dot-notebook.svg\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"ptile__body\"><span class=\"ptile__name\">Tapis cover notebook, A5</span><span class=\"ptile__meta\">120 in stock</span></span><span class=\"ptile__price\">Rp 30.000</span><span class=\"ptile__qty\">1</span></button>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
